---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import cfg from '../../../../branding.config.json';

const repoUrl = `https://github.com/${cfg.orgHandle}/${cfg.repoName}`;
---

<Site
  title="Quickstart"
  description="Install, lint, typecheck, and test. The exact commands contributors run."
>
  <div class="content">
    <h2>Quickstart</h2>
    <p>
      The repository builds with pinned toolchains (Node 24 via pnpm,
      Rust 1.100.0 via rustup). Every command below is also a CI gate,
      so local green means CI green.
    </p>
    <pre><code>pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm lint
pnpm typecheck
pnpm test
cargo check --workspace
cargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings</code></pre>
    <h2>Conventions that block merges</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every commit carries a signed-off-by trailer.</li>
      <li>Conventional commits with a prompt scope.</li>
      <li>No secrets in the tree. Ever.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Full contributor rules live in the repository:
      <a href={repoUrl}>read them there</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Site>
